96:      - `currentRestoreMap` records `[REDACTED:API_KEY] -> sk-2222...` (Key 2 overwrites Key 1).
97:      - Restoring an LLM response `"Deployed [REDACTED:API_KEY] and [REDACTED:API_KEY]"` restores `sk-2222...` for both instances. Key 1 is permanently destroyed and cannot be restored.
